{
    "title": "ExpressVPN: VPN Fast & Secure",
    "description": "<b>ExpressVPN: Secure & Stream Like Never Before \u2013 Premium VPN for Speed and Privacy</b>\r\n\r\nUnlock premium security and fast, reliable connections with ExpressVPN. The top choice for secure browsing and streaming, ExpressVPN\u2019s advanced encryption keeps your data safe on any network, whether public Wi-Fi or at home. Get fast servers in 105 locations, including many U.S. states, for streaming live sports like the Super Bowl, World Series, and more.\r\n\r\nTry ExpressVPN with a 7-day free trial on your Android device and enjoy private browsing with our no-logs policy. Our next-gen Lightway protocol guarantees speed, security, and reliability. Available in 18 languages, with 24/7 support, download ExpressVPN now!\r\n\r\n<b>\u25cf 7-day free trial</b>\r\nDownload the best VPN and enjoy a 7-day free trial. You will get to experience all the features ExpressVPN has to offer.\r\n\r\n<b>\u25cf World\u2019s top premium VPN provider</b>\r\nExpressVPN is rated Excellent by 22,000+ reviewers on Trustpilot and has been crowned the best VPN by PCWorld, The Verge, TechRadar, and more.\r\n\r\n<b>\u25cf Fast connection speeds</b>\r\nConnect to one of our many fast VPN servers in 105 countries. With ExpressVPN\u2019s easy IP changer, fake out cyber snoops and criminals.\r\n\r\n<b>\u25cf Access your favorite content with an unlimited VPN</b>\r\nGet unlimited bandwidth and secure access to a world of your favorite digital content, including movies, TV shows, music, podcasts, and more. \r\n\r\n<b>\u25cf Powerful online security</b>\r\nProtect your data and keep your online activity private with best-in-class VPN encryption. Secure your connection on public Wi-Fi and browse anonymously wherever you are.\r\n\r\n<b>\u25cf Strict no-logs policy</b>\r\nExpressVPN\u2019s no-log policy, independently audited for your protection, lets you browse safely with complete peace of mind\u2014no activity or connection logs are ever kept.\r\n\r\n<b>\u25cf Next-gen VPN protocol</b>\r\nGet exclusive access to Lightway, a VPN protocol developed by ExpressVPN that offers greater speed, security, and reliability.\r\n\r\n<b>\u25cf Apps or every device</b>\r\nEnjoy the best VPN protection on all your devices, including Windows, Mac, iOS, Android, Linux, Smart TVs, and more. With just one plan, you can protect up to 8 devices.\r\n\r\n<b>\u25cf Built-in password manager</b>\r\nExpressVPN Keys is a powerful password manager that safeguards more than passwords. Generate, store, and autofill unlimited passwords, securely save credit card details, and get alerts for compromised passwords and data breaches.\r\n\r\n<b>\u25cf Large selection of languages</b>\r\nExpressVPN is currently available in 18 languages.\r\n\r\n<b>\u25cf Five-star customer service</b>\r\nGet help quickly and efficiently. Ask us anything at any time, via our 24/7 live chat support or email.\r\n\r\n<b>Android app features:</b>\r\n\u2714 The built-in kill switch, available on Android 8 and higher, stops all internet traffic if your VPN connection drops.\r\n\u2714 With split tunneling, you can select which apps use the VPN and which bypasses it.\r\n\u2714 ExpressVPN Keys securely stores unlimited passwords, notes, and credit card details in the password manager.\r\n\u2714 A convenient widget lets you easily connect to or disconnect from ExpressVPN, switch servers, or check your VPN status.\r\n\u2714 The app automatically connects on untrusted Wi-Fi and reconnects if your VPN connection is interrupted.\r\n\u2714 ExpressVPN\u2019s encryption supports Lightway UDP/TCP and OpenVPN UDP/TCP protocols for secure browsing.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>ExpressVPN: Secure &amp; Stream Like Never Before \u2013 Premium VPN for Speed and Privacy</b><br><br>Unlock premium security and fast, reliable connections with ExpressVPN. The top choice for secure browsing and streaming, ExpressVPN\u2019s advanced encryption keeps your data safe on any network, whether public Wi-Fi or at home. Get fast servers in 105 locations, including many U.S. states, for streaming live sports like the Super Bowl, World Series, and more.<br><br>Try ExpressVPN with a 7-day free trial on your Android device and enjoy private browsing with our no-logs policy. Our next-gen Lightway protocol guarantees speed, security, and reliability. Available in 18 languages, with 24/7 support, download ExpressVPN now!<br><br><b>\u25cf 7-day free trial</b><br>Download the best VPN and enjoy a 7-day free trial. You will get to experience all the features ExpressVPN has to offer.<br><br><b>\u25cf World\u2019s top premium VPN provider</b><br>ExpressVPN is rated Excellent by 22,000+ reviewers on Trustpilot and has been crowned the best VPN by PCWorld, The Verge, TechRadar, and more.<br><br><b>\u25cf Fast connection speeds</b><br>Connect to one of our many fast VPN servers in 105 countries. With ExpressVPN\u2019s easy IP changer, fake out cyber snoops and criminals.<br><br><b>\u25cf Access your favorite content with an unlimited VPN</b><br>Get unlimited bandwidth and secure access to a world of your favorite digital content, including movies, TV shows, music, podcasts, and more. <br><br><b>\u25cf Powerful online security</b><br>Protect your data and keep your online activity private with best-in-class VPN encryption. Secure your connection on public Wi-Fi and browse anonymously wherever you are.<br><br><b>\u25cf Strict no-logs policy</b><br>ExpressVPN\u2019s no-log policy, independently audited for your protection, lets you browse safely with complete peace of mind\u2014no activity or connection logs are ever kept.<br><br><b>\u25cf Next-gen VPN protocol</b><br>Get exclusive access to Lightway, a VPN protocol developed by ExpressVPN that offers greater speed, security, and reliability.<br><br><b>\u25cf Apps or every device</b><br>Enjoy the best VPN protection on all your devices, including Windows, Mac, iOS, Android, Linux, Smart TVs, and more. With just one plan, you can protect up to 8 devices.<br><br><b>\u25cf Built-in password manager</b><br>ExpressVPN Keys is a powerful password manager that safeguards more than passwords. Generate, store, and autofill unlimited passwords, securely save credit card details, and get alerts for compromised passwords and data breaches.<br><br><b>\u25cf Large selection of languages</b><br>ExpressVPN is currently available in 18 languages.<br><br><b>\u25cf Five-star customer service</b><br>Get help quickly and efficiently. Ask us anything at any time, via our 24/7 live chat support or email.<br><br><b>Android app features:</b><br>\u2714 The built-in kill switch, available on Android 8 and higher, stops all internet traffic if your VPN connection drops.<br>\u2714 With split tunneling, you can select which apps use the VPN and which bypasses it.<br>\u2714 ExpressVPN Keys securely stores unlimited passwords, notes, and credit card details in the password manager.<br>\u2714 A convenient widget lets you easily connect to or disconnect from ExpressVPN, switch servers, or check your VPN status.<br>\u2714 The app automatically connects on untrusted Wi-Fi and reconnects if your VPN connection is interrupted.<br>\u2714 ExpressVPN\u2019s encryption supports Lightway UDP/TCP and OpenVPN UDP/TCP protocols for secure browsing.",
